            "body": "This would be a great improvement!\r\nFor some reason, on my system the dataloader workers are created using `spawn` and thus the dataset was pickled for each new dataset worker. This led to the the error\r\n `AttributeError: 'RLHFDataset' object has no attribute 'dataframe'`\r\nuntil I manually set `dataset.serialize_dataset = True`.\r\n\r\nWith the change from this pull-request the error is fixed, thank you @zouxu09  !",
